    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose one of the Dead Three: Bane, Bhaal, or Myrkul. You gain Resistance to one type of damage and the ability to cast a cantrip, as detailed in the table below; Intelligence is your spellcasting ability for this cantrip. When you finish a Long Rest, you can change your choice.</p><table><caption>Dread Allegiance Boons</caption><thead><tr><th>God</th><th>Damage Resistance</th><th>Cantrip</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Bane</p></td><td><p>Psychic</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.materia-dnd.spells.Item.matSplMinorIllus]{Minor Illusion}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Bhaal</p></td><td><p>Poison</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.materia-dnd.spells.Item.matSplBladeWard0]{Blade Ward}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Myrkul</p></td><td><p>Necrotic</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.materia-dnd.spells.Item.matSplSpectralHa]{Spectral Hand}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><section id=\"secret-PoV5Ji3pctOpH8Vo\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes inactive effects for each of the Resistances provided.  When you make your selection you can activate the appropriate one and delete the others.</p><p>Additionally, you can drag the Cantrip from this feature onto your character sheet to grant it to yourself.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
